WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:05.171
Before dawn this morning, on Iguni Street,

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:09.509
a group of carnivores attacked
a 22-year-old Thomson's gazelle, Linda,

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:12.512
and killed her by biting her neck.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:16.224
Well, there are lots of horrifying crimes
going on out there.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.394
...suspects are still on the run.
According to the witness...

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.062
-This is not good.
-...a gray wolf...

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.523
-I'll go back to the dorm.
-...a coyote and Canidae...

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.067
You guys won the game.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.820
But you were winning...

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:33.908
As the Canidae is sociable
and highly bonded...

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.536
Don't worry. It's nothing unusual.

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:39.706
DEVOURING CASE
SUSPECTS ON THE RUN

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:43.835
To be honest, we carnivores are used to
this kind of uncomfortable situation.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:48.381
No! Let go of me!

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.550
Look at the news!

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:54.804
They say that the leader of the suspects
is a gray wolf.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.098
I'm not like them!

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:00.393
-That's how everybody sees you!
-They're not just teasing her.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.645
How would I help her?

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.731
Hey, you!

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:07.067
Well, this is complicated.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:10.070
Maybe I shouldn't put my nose
into other people's business.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.780
Are you listening to me?

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:14.741
If you are one of them,
show me what you've got.

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:16.951
Excuse me?

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.082
I'm her brother.

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:24.167
What is going on?

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.669
Her... brother?

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.754
Yes.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:32.342
Shoot! She doesn't look like me at all.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:36.429
-Liar! She doesn't look like you at all.
-That's right!

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:39.808
I look like our father
and she looks like our mother.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.894
Are you all right?

00:01:46.314 --> 00:01:48.733
Thanks, bro...

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.611
Let's go.

